+        <div class="bmc-cell bmc-parceiros reveal">
+          <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="m16 11 2 2 4-4"/></svg>Parceiros-chave</h3>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Fabricantes de switches, APs e sensores</li>
+            <li>FreeRADIUS / MQTT Mosquitto (open source)</li>
