+        <div class="bmc-cell bmc-atividades reveal">
+          <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-6 6L3 18l3 3 5.7-5.7a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 6-6L14 13l-3-3 3.7-3.7Z"/></svg>Atividades-chave</h3>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Segmentação por VLANs com QoS estrito</li>
+            <li>Hardening L2 e autenticação 802.1X/EAP-TLS</li>
+            <li>Testes iperf3 e certificação Fluke ponto a ponto</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="bmc-cell bmc-recursos reveal">
+          <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8v13H3V8M1 3h22v5H1zM10 12h4"/></svg>Recursos-chave</h3>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Backbone Cat6A + fibra 10 GbE e PoE++</li>
+            <li>Wi-Fi 6/6E industrial e gateways MQTT</li>
